From 236d4d5f0d69f86dc283060d63a4f1b9debcade5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Unleashed <codex-unleashed@holdmyspot.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:15:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): collapse tool activity only with project opt-in

Require [codex_unleashed] collapsed_tool_activity = true (default false)
and the stable default-on unleashed_collapsed_tool_activity feature flag.
Use one Config gate for live command notifications and resumed history.
Register the boolean setting even while the feature is disabled, retaining
normal unknown-key warnings for undeclared fields and rejecting non-booleans.

Prerequisite: base-configuration/codex-unleashed-configuration.patch

Configuration TDD receipts (Rust 1.95.0, RUST_MIN_STACK=16777216):
- cargo test -p codex-tui --lib unleashed_collapsed_tool_activity_requires_project_opt_in
  RED: default configuration groups 2 calls instead of 1.
- cargo test -p codex-tui --lib unleashed_collapsed_tool_activity
  RED: 9 passed, 2 failed; default live and resumed grouping bypass opt-in.
  GREEN: 11 passed, covering absent/false/true, feature-off, invalid boolean,
  retained resumed commands/output/failures, and existing mouse/lifecycle behavior.
- cargo test -p codex-core --lib project_codex_unleashed_collapsed_tool_activity_is_silent_when_feature_disabled
  RED: trusted project warns about codex_unleashed.collapsed_tool_activity.
  GREEN: no startup warnings with feature disabled.
- cargo test -p codex-core --lib codex_unleashed: all selected tests pass,
  including strict rejection of undeclared fields and expanded-preview settings.

Original presentation TDD and regression receipts:
Group adjacent agent file reads and shell calls, keep full retained output
available, highlight collapsed summaries on hover, and make whole section
clicks toggle a gray expanded surface. Collapse this turn's sections at
completion. Preserve upstream presentation when the new stable, default-on
unleashed_collapsed_tool_activity flag is disabled.

Base: openai/codex rust-v0.159.2
ff6aec96948b70d94983af2641a6b67c94faeff5

